
 T95 (Allwinner H616) - Debian GNU/Linux 13, mainline U-Boot/TF-A
 ----------------------------------------------------------------
  set the timezone   sudo timedatectl set-timezone Region/City
  add an SSH key     ssh-copy-id <user>@<this box>   (from your PC)
  install to eMMC    sudo t95-install-emmc           (when booted from SD)
  front panel        /sys/bus/i2c/devices/0-0024/chars, /sys/class/leds/fd6551::*
  crash reports      /var/lib/systemd/pstore/

